{
  "id": "04",
  "title": "Context 上下文",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.12) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.04) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.2); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 32px; margin-bottom: 60px; border-radius: 4px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: -20px; right: -20px; opacity: 0.05; transform: rotate(15deg);\"><svg width=\"120\" height=\"120\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FFB800\" stroke-width=\"1\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"/></svg></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-weight: 300;\">Photon 的 <strong>Context 上下文物件</strong> 是一個高階封裝的調度對象，旨在以近乎零分配的開銷管理整個請求-響應生命週期。</p></div><h2>架構核心</h2><p>Context 物件扮演著應用程式神經中樞的角色。與傳統框架每次請求都重新建立物件不同，Photon 採用進階的物件池 (Pooling) 技術來回收 Context 實例。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px; margin: 48px 0;\" class=\"bento-grid\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"> <div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">身份矩陣</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">具備完整的 TypeScript 推導，輕鬆注入與提取請求範圍的依賴項（如 Auth, DB, Logging）。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">深層重置</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">Context 回收技術通過分發前的重置協定避免 GC 壓力，實現高度的效能優化。</p></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.3s ease;\" onmouseover=\"this.style.borderColor='rgba(255,184,0,0.4)'; this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)'\" onmouseout=\"this.style.borderColor='var(--border-subtle)'; this.style.transform='translateY(0)'\"><div style=\"color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; tracking: 0.05em; border: none; padding: 0;\">O(1) 調度</h3><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; padding: 0; border: none;\">透過 <code>FastContext</code> 的二進位兼容查找表，即時存取預解析的路徑參數與標頭內容。</p></div></div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; color: #FFB800; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em;\">// 系統日誌：CONTEXT_RESET_PROTOCOL</h4><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; font-style: italic; color: var(--text-heading); opacity: 0.9; border: none; padding: 0;\">請求完成後，<strong>Safe-Flush</strong> 協定會清除 Context 內部的映射表而不釋放底層物件，從而有效消除每請求的記憶體碎片。</p></div><h2>請求存取策略</h2><p>使用作用域輔助函數高效存取請求數據。Photon 確保查詢字串與路徑片段的存取具備零冗餘分配。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">路徑與查詢</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:12px;\"><code>// 以光速提取數據\nconst id = c.req.param('id')\nconst page = c.req.query('p')\nconst all = c.req.query()</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #D1D5DB; text-transform: uppercase;\">現代化主體解析</h4><pre style=\"margin:0; padding:0; background:transparent; font-size:12px;\"><code>// JIT 優化解析\nconst json = await c.req.json()\nconst form = await c.req.parseBody()\nconst data = await c.req.formData()</code></pre></div></div><h2>效能視覺化</h2><p>在高併發環境下對比使用 <strong>Context 回收技術</strong> 前後的垃圾回收 (GC) 壓力。</p><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 32px; margin: 40px 0; border-radius: 4px;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFB800; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>PHOTON_CONTEXT_POOLING</span> <span>0% GC 開銷</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,184,0,0.1); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 2%; background: #FFB800; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,184,0,0.5);\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #6B7280; margin-bottom: 12px; font-family: var(--font-technical);\"><span>常規框架物件分配</span> <span>~12.4% GC 停頓</span></div><div style=\"height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); width: 100%; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;\"><div style=\"height: 100%; width: 85%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div></div></div><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; font-family: var(--font-technical); border: none; padding: 0;\">// 效益：微服務架構下的近乎無限擴展</p></div><h2>狀態管理</h2><p>Context 變數為中介軟體鏈提供了強大的共享狀態，並通過全域介面擴展支持型別安全。</p><pre><code>// 1. 在中介軟體設定狀態\nc.set('user', authResult)\n\n// 2. 信心滿滿地提取\nconst user = c.get('user')\n\n// 3. 型別安全保護 (types/context.d.ts)\ndeclare module '@gravito/core' {\n  interface GravitoVariables {\n    user: UserProfile\n  }\n}</code></pre><h2>回應調度</h2><p>鏈式輔助函數實現優化交付。Photon 會根據標頭自動協商最快的編碼方式 (JSON/CBOR/Text)。</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; margin: 40px 0;\"><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">原子化回應</h3><p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 16px;\">針對常見 MIME 型別的直接回應助手。</p><pre style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><code>return c.json({ data })\nreturn c.text('OK')\nreturn c.html('&lt;div/&gt;')</code></pre></div><div style=\"background: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding: 24px; border-radius: 4px;\"><h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0 0 12px 0;\">狀態輔助</h3><p style=\"font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 16px;\">提高程式碼可讀性的語義化錯誤處理。</p><pre style=\"font-size: 11px;\"><code>return c.notFound()\nreturn c.forbidden()\nreturn c.unauthorized()</code></pre></div></div><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1), transparent); border-left: 4px solid #10B981; padding: 24px; margin-top: 60px; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; font-style: italic; border: none; padding: 0; color: var(--text-heading);\"><strong>專業洞察：</strong> 使用 <code>c.forward()</code> 實現零複製反向代理。Photon 會直接將請求主體串流傳輸到上游服務，而不必在記憶體中進行緩衝。</p></div>",
